  "application_type_full": "Householder planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;By reason of the bulk, massing, scale and detailed design, which would fail to take reference from the existing architectural character and appearance of the existing property, the proposal would appear as an incongruous enlargement to the host property and wider terrace, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the host property and the surrounding area. The proposed development would, therefore, conflict with Policies D1 of the London Plan (2021); Policy LP1 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020); and the guidance as contained within the Council’s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2025).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;By reason of size, design and siting of the extension, the proposed development would result in loss of daylight, sunlight and overshadowing, to the detriment of neighbouring residential occupiers, contrary to Policy LP2 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
